WEBVTT

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:18.600
Sorry for the wait.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.480
You don't look familiar.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.600
I'm new here.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.060
Your name?

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.480
Makoto.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.570
Blade of the Immortal

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.120
One, two, three

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:42.660
Undead tree

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.830
What truth

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.380
I'll come true

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:55.510
Wow...

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.390
I see that bright light

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.770
This is all I have

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.270
What did you say?
I know

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:14.820
Why do you say?

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.490
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:27.460
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:31.550
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.300
Survive of vision

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.590
Unfinished heaven

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:42.350
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.100
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.900
Survive of vision

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:02.240
There are two things I'd like to ask.

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.040
First of all, what are you guys even about?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:10.500
What, you ask? We're the Mugai-ryu.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:14.630
And honestly, while we are a school,
functionally speaking, we're just rogues.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:21.930
Then, next question.
What's all this about Anotsu submitting three drafts,

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.100
being accompanied by at least four swordsmen,

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:27.940
and his reason for going to Kaga

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:32.480
being to annex a certain dojo?

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.860
All rumors you rogues just heard on the wind?

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:41.070
Then there's the girl's kimono and all that.
It's like you've got someone on the inside.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.030
As it turns out, we do.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:50.330
I learned all that from our insider,
so the information is 80 percent reliable.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.880
Eighty percent? Eighty percent, huh?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.630
Well, how about it, Mr. Manji?

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.970
I don't think it's a bad deal.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.010
Is that all?

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.010
When asking for someone's backing,

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:07.640
you should reveal your entire hand to that person.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.940
Don't you think, Shira?

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:14.900
Blond girl, this is some mighty fine sake.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:17.320
A few shelves above what some rogues could afford.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:24.620
And then there's this place.
Isn't this way overboard for a ronin's nest?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:29.460
Unless there's someone behind the scenes.
That'd be different.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.420
What's that?

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.550
He was wearing a kimono with that pattern.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.010
The guy who killed Ren three days ago.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.260
Well, what you do about it is up to you.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.140
Hey.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.600
Why did you leave her laying in the dirt?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.190
That's too much.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:59.400
We chose the spot it'd be coolest!
For the idiot who never said when he'd be back!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:04.370
I didn't want you to see her rotting away!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:08.450
Ren always said she just wanted to be with you forever.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.540
That's truly all she ever...

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.250
Is that such an extravagant wish?
Too much to ask?

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:20.210
Curse you swordsmen.
Look what your sword's done to her!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.800
Don't come here again!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:30.980
Try inhaling this.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.350
You'll calm down and sleep much better.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.020
Well... I suppose a little then.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:41.820
Oh, like an old pro.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.320
Maybe it's still too soon. Sorry, sorry.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:53.120
So... about what Mr. Manji said this afternoon.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.250
I thought he would be a little dumber, that man.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.760
Well, maybe it's best we only cooperate.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.720
-So--
-I can't say just yet.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.600
You'll find out about us eventually.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:11.890
But I do think

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:17.520
there may be things in the world it's okay not to know,
and that you shouldn't know.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:23.190
Ms. Hyakurin, are you the leader here?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.570
No, why?

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:28.780
You're sort of the easiest to understand,
and very impactful despite your youth--

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.750
Thank you! But I'm a good ten years older than you.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:34.750
What?

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:38.830
I had a house in the past.
A family with kids, two of them.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.420
What? What are your kids--?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.670
That man, is he good to you?

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:47.590
What? That's not how Manji and I...

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:53.640
Well, not that it's any of my concern,
but down the road there may be hardships.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.770
If you fall for a man like him.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:01.520
But he's not a bad person.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:04.030
Despite his appearance.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:08.700
I've never seen him kill an unarmed person.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:15.000
And because of my weakness, his bones
are always broken. He's always covered in blood.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.620
That's all that ever happens to him.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:19.630
Hey...

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.670
You might find it hard to get stronger
if all you want is a man's protection.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.720
But what do I know?
All right, bedtime.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:41.860
Don't worry.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:46.150
That's her disease.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.110
Ms. Hyakurin!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:54.080
I'm sorry, please don't be worried.
This just happens sometimes.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:07:00.580
Rin... you mustn't fall for a samurai.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:15.890
Naito Shinjuku, huh?

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.350
I've been walking all over the place,

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:23.020
but I guess I've never really been outside of Edo.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.190
Still,

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.780
this guy just seems to sleep all the time.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.950
What are you doing?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:38.750
Didn't that feel good?

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.000
Is that all you wanted?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:44.330
Sorry, but it's still light out.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:47.050
You should stay awake and chat.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:50.010
I just don't want to be alone.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.140
Don't be surprised at whatever comes out.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.100
It should be worth cleaning then.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:02.270
What are you so scared of?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.770
What, you ask?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.060
You're afraid to face Anotsu.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.570
But it's not that he's scary.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:16.200
I've come up with a way to overcome my own weakness.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:19.950
That said, it only applies to my mental state.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.670
My skills are...another story.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.630
So, listen, the next time I see that man,

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:29.630
I think I'll be ready to crush him like an insect.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:34.050
Although this time he might be killed
by you or Mr. Shira before I get a chance.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:40.680
Oh, my, my, my.
What a precious scene we have here.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:45.100
Well, you guys won't be going outside
for fear of being identified,

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.810
so let's all try to get comfortable.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.610
And another thing...

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:53.780
I heard an interesting story about Anotsu

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.860
from our comrade first thing this morning.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.040
Mr. Abayama, where is the master?

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.700
He left this morning.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.040
So he really was going to wear that kimono?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.250
He proposed it himself.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.380
Cross-dressing?

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:17.590
-Unthinkable.
-A revolting affair.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:21.600
However, if you're unaware,
they do have ways of pulling you in.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:27.440
But if he's working as an unlicensed prostitute,
passing through the gate would be troublesome.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.820
There are two possibilities.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:34.860
Slip the gate, or make connections
in the Shogunate.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.990
I believe that's plausible.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:42.080
Two years ago, when the Muten Ichi-ryu was attacked,

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.290
I went to file reports for two days straight,

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:47.920
but for whatever reason, they're beyond rebuke.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.290
But isn't that a little strange?

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:56.130
Was the Itto-ryu connected in some way
to the Shogunate at that time?

00:09:56.840 --> 00:10:01.310
Or was the Shogunate just putting up with them
to later make use of them?

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:02.760
Does it seem possible?

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.730
Have you ever seen Anotsu?

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:05.930
Yes.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.770
Just on that day two years ago?

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.770
Actually, I saw him the other day.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:16.190
Mr. Manji, the rest will be for the celebration at dawn.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:21.660
So some pickles, then what?

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:23.830
That's all, thanks.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.750
I don't mean to be overly suspicious,

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:32.500
but neither Buddhists nor vacationers stay around here
for two days.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:38.430
And you're not here to buy women,
so I can't help but wonder why you're here.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.930
Some shady stuff?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.720
Well, it is what it is.

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:50.730
You're not sleeping with the two of them are you?

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.900
What? Of course not!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:58.570
Well, good. Men are all idiots
with no sense of moderation.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:02.780
If you were with a couple guys like that,
you'd swell right up.

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.490
Swell...?

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.370
Just saying, girls don't always get it so easy.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:15.550
Can I ask you something?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.090
Have you ever gone through the Kobotoke gate?

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:23.180
Just once. I do hear about it a lot, due to my job.

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:25.890
Then...

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.180
if for example,

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:31.770
a cross-dressing man was driven by desire
to go through that gate,

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:35.110
what would be a good way for him to do that?

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.570
I don't know what you're talking about,
but do you think they'd miss that at a checkpoint?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.990
Don't take the officials lightly.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.620
So it really is impossible without connections.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:49.000
That's what I mean by taking it lightly.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:54.290
The guards' intuitions are much more sharp
than you realize.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:58.000
Plus, the ones on gate duty have been inheriting it
for generations.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.760
They rarely ever retire.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:04.140
Their faith in the Shogunate is that passionate.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.470
Half-baked connections and bribes

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.560
will just end up tying your own noose.

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.400
But that was all hypothetical, right?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:20.490
Take what I'm about to say with a grain of salt as well.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.030
There is but one.

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:28.490
No matter who you may be,
there's a way to slip through.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.620
Does Anotsu have any prominent features?

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:37.590
Features? But isn't he cross-dressing--?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:41.170
Stupid, nothing got torn off of him, it's just clothing.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.800
There's no way to hide walking habits
or mannerisms.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.390
That may be true, but...

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.220
-Whoa, he's drawn!
-You bastard!

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.730
You would mock me, Kagehisa Anotsu,
the head of the Itto-ryu?

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:58.980
I might as well ask, is that...?

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.360
Not even close.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:03.780
Didn't think so.
There was no point in him giving his name.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.410
Then, why?

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:06.820
Why?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.080
Hey, look over there.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.500
What about that umbrella looking one?

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.010
-There! A hatchet!
-Hatchet?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:27.640
That wrapping cloth was holding a weapon
with the same shape as his.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:30.600
It's too heavy for a woman to be holding like that,

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.810
but if it's not a woman...

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.270
Perfect...

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.400
Sorry to the guys with their line cast
in a river somewhere,

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.820
but this is the catch of the century.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.280
There's no doubt then.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.660
-Let's go, Shinriji.
-Right.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.710
That's Anotsu?

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:03.130
Should I call Rin? No, there's no guarantee
they'll still be here doing this.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:15.890
-We've walked about four and a half Ri.
-What?

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.810
-Wait! Hey!
-What is it?

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.440
Mr. Shira, you can't just swoop in from behind!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:27.070
At least try saying, "You dropped something,"
to confirm the face.

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:28.910
That's such a pain.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.240
I like this guy.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.660
He wants to go right here.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.540
Excuse me, you dropped your purse over here.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.130
She said you dropped something!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.840
I will put this sword the last place you want it!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:03.770
Hey, don't you normally show gratitude
before picking it up?

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.780
By taking off your hat.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.140
You're not... a man, are you?

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:40.690
How horrible, and my face is my selling point.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.110
He planned this well.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:52.740
You even had an insider. Too bad.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.450
That Anotsu has really thought of everything, huh?

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.710
So he gets to wait in Shishuku,
while he sends you here to die as bait?

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:10.050
No, I've been told to acquire the name of the mole
before then, at any cost.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.300
Who's going to be acquiring? You?

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:19.270
Me? I'm nothing more than a prostitute used as bait.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.270
See?

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.730
Long time no see, Mr. Saikaya.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:33.820
What a coincidence, Ms. Sei.
How have you been since last time?

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:36.910
I've been swell. How about you?

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:42.460
This and that. If the doctor says
being hated for your success is medicine,

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:45.630
then I'd love to be hated just a bit more.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:51.760
That said, I've only been putting real effort
into trivial things.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.760
So, what should we do about them?

00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:59.220
I'll leave them to you. This is where my usefulness ends.

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.310
Naturally.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.480
Shall we play a game of Iwami Mine mousetrap?

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:19.530
Three ryo split two ways... That's not including the hiring.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:25.580
Why can't I just get the jobs to kill one person
for 30 ryo?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:29.340
I admire your ability to move past being shocked.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.590
What in the world did you plan to do

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.210
with that saw-like thing?

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.760
Now that it's come to this, let me say,

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.970
no matter what happens, don't draw your sword.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.600
Everything before my eyes

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.430
is my toy.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.400
My regrets...

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.320
Okay, where did the real one go?

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:00.830
They didn't beg for their lives once.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.830
I'd call that a win for them.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:05.460
-Mr. Shira.
-Don't come out.

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:08.040
-That's not all of them.
-It's not?

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.670
Wait, Mr. Shira?

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.380
-No.
-Wait!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.300
Mr. Shira!

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:24.930
Shinriji, what is the meaning of all this?

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:29.150
Well, wasn't he supposed to be cross-dressing?

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.780
An average prostitute shouldn't be out here.

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:39.450
I'm starting to look down on Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.950
But he said you wouldn't bother
killing someone who isn't a swordsman.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:46.870
What kind of idiot gambles on their enemy's good will?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:47.960
In this world,

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:52.590
there are people so unhinged,
that boy would struggle to comprehend it.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:55.760
Mr. Shira!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:57.550
What's with you?

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:01.090
Don't you think you've done enough?
Let's just leave.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.510
Of course not!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:07.730
I've told you twice not to butt in.

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:15.610
This view really takes me back.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:19.150
In the past, we were chasing some kid
from the Itto-ryu,

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:23.070
and I remember doing the same thing to his girl.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.660
I'm not a complete demon though.

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:29.660
My heart was truly in pain that time.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:32.540
But today, I don't feel sorry.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.540
If you're angry,

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:39.090
you can blame your boss for not expecting
this kind of thing to happen.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.050
Right?

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.680
Oops, sorry about that!

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.640
-There we go.
-Stop--

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:52.560
You're a whore, aren't you?
Don't be so cold to your customer.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:03.240
No... Please, forgive me.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.410
For mercy's sake!

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.120
No!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:13.250
That's right. What a sight

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:18.710
to see a woman writhing in pain,
her stomach convulsing in waves.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:22.470
Like watching a snake on the verge of death.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:28.720
I guess I shouldn't be too rough with you just yet.

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.730
I can't have you finish before I put it in.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.100
I'd hate to only put you through suffering,

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.070
so I'll make sure you'll have a sweet time.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.530
What you've been doing makes me want to vomit...

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.450
but I felt like you were teaching me what I was missing.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.790
But that was all just my misunderstanding!

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:00.550
Until a moment ago,
I thought you were an ally of mine.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:04.130
But I actually despise people like you.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:07.850
You're just like them! Just like the people I resent!

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.140
Are you done now?

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.480
Then keep your mouth shut.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.690
It's a real buzzkill with you making a fuss back there.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.110
Give me a break.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:34.210
What is this?

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.340
Oh, did that hit you? My bad.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.630
Just pay it no mind, Shira.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:42.590
Mr. Manji!

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.880
I'm having trouble grasping the situation here.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:49.510
Where is he? Where's Anotsu?

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:53.470
And what have you been up to here,
stripping a woman?

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:58.270
My hand!

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.770
Manji!

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:03.570
He's killing for sport!

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:12.540
You're kidding me!

00:22:12.620 --> 00:22:15.830
No matter how you look at this,
it'll look like my doing!

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:18.330
-Come on, let's go, Rin!
-Hold on.

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:24.260
Do you think she'll be all right?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:25.630
It's up to fate.

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:33.470
I'm such a fool.

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:52.720
Act Eight - Mugai-ryu
